OL,3,GNEWSACouncil investigating 80          
OL,4,Afly-tipped bonfires                    
OL,6,FDumped sofas, cabinets and mattresses  
OL,7,Fwere used to build fires in a town     
OL,8,Fahead of Bonfire Night.                
OL,10,FMiddlesbrough Council is investigating 
OL,11,Fmore than 80 instances of such waste   
OL,12,Fbeing used to make bonfires.           
OL,14,FIt said it was using CCTV footage to   
OL,15,Ftrack vans, cars and trucks, often     
OL,16,Fbearing company logos, seen dumping the
OL,17,Fwaste as part of Bonfire Night clean-up
OL,18,Fefforts.                               
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
