OL,3,GNEWSACouncil investigating 80          
OL,4,Afly-tipped bonfires                    
OL,6,FMiddlesbrough Mayor Chris Cooke said   
OL,7,Fthe town was "not a dumping ground" and
OL,8,Fthose responsible would face the       
OL,9,Fconsequences.                          
